<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Incomplete task"> <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/innerHTML" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Element.innerHTML</code> </a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">This is in progress:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Addd boilerplate</li>
<li>Add links to recommended alternatives - really you should use setHTML.</li>
<li>Add TT information, including the new exception</li>
<li>Restructured - this isn't to current templates. Need to move the guidish stuff either down as examples or up into description</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Still looking at the examples and structure. I expect next to make them all use TT by default.</p>
<p dir="auto">Part of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2770544982" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/37518/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518">#37518</a> (tracking issue)</p>]]></content>
